  <item>
    <title>VOL 5丨辣椒油涂腿、重金买破布……变美弯路上怎么总有我</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675aaca984447b1bd058c740</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675aaca984447b1bd058c740</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 12 Dec 2024 09:37:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>💣跟着博主买全身</span></p><span></span><p><span>💣高价入手黑科技</span></p><span></span><p><span>💣盲目all in网红店……</span></p><span></span><p><span>为了变美，你踩了多少雷？</span></p><span></span><p><span>又该如何做到</span><strong><span>低成本且有效</span></strong><span>的变美呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期U TALK👧🏻✨</span></p><span></span><p><span>邀请三位砖家，和大家聊聊在变美的路上</span></p><span></span><p><span>✅ 哪些地方</span><strong><span>最容易猛猛踩坑</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>✅ 哪些方面</span><strong><span>最花小钱办大事</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>✅ 如何</span><strong><span>找准对标，在最短时间内实现突破</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>通过嘉宾们的血泪史</span></p><span></span><p><span>力求让每个人都能事半功倍地变美！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤主播和嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>U TALK主理人丨蕾蕾</span></p><span></span><p><span>从业9年资深化妆师 丨小雨</span></p><span></span><p><span>某音人气主播丨椰子</span></p><span></span><p><span>你将听到 ↓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong><span>嘉宾介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="411">06:51</a> </span><strong><span>变美弯路合集（重金整理版）</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> &nbsp;跟着博主买衣服，下水全都变抹布&nbsp;</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a> &nbsp;为合群斥巨资捯饬穿搭，结果…</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 风很大瘦腿霜，本质竟是辣椒油</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">05:17</a> &nbsp;单价1W+的YSL口红的血泪惨案</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="346">05:46</a> 设华而不实的“镇店之宝”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="411">06:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> </span><strong><span>变美小捷径（亲测有效版）</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a> &nbsp;节食不是捷径，减肥的核心是热量差+自驱力</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">08:26</a> &nbsp;找准穿衣风格前提：认识自己，不要预设，不要跟风</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;拒绝恋爱脑！为了迎合男友喜好的改变没有好下场</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;0成本提高美商方式</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> &nbsp;模仿博主，普通女孩最速变美传说</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1003">16:43</a> </span><strong><span>美有千姿百态，不要拘泥于某个小点把路走窄</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>最后~我们说的变美，不是要变成顶级美女</span></p><span></span><p><span>而是让自己</span><strong><span>一点点变成自己想成为的样子</span></strong><span>💖</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>更自信、更爱自己</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>最终实现整个人生的良性循环</span></strong><span>💖</span></p><span></span><p><span>万万不可本末倒置🚫</span></p><span></span><p><span>只追求变美放弃事业甚至健康⚠️</span></p>]]></description>
