    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>离春节还有不到一周的时间</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家在奔赴家乡的同时</span></p><span></span><p><span>也在为「回家」这一“</span><strong><span>甜蜜的烦恼</span></strong><span>”辗转反侧：</span></p><span></span><p><span>伴随着假期而来的，除了宝贵的休息时间</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有亲戚们</span><strong><span>无穷无尽地盘问</span></strong><span> ↓</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>“做什么工作的？”“每个月赚多少啊？”</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>“结婚了吗？”“找到对象没啊？”</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期U TALK，邀请两位好朋友——</span><strong><span>刚毕业的单身00后·安徽甜妹红提</span></strong><span>，以及有</span><strong><span>稳定对象暂未结婚的90后·新疆美妞周四</span></strong><span>，从她们当地的春节习俗切入，通过经典social场景的复刻和演绎，共同探讨</span><strong><span>如何应付亲戚们“突如其来的关心”，答好“春节送命题”</span></strong><span>。希望本期内容，能够为焦头烂额的你，提供一些参考性话术和破局方向。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤</span><strong><span>主播和嘉宾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>U TALK主理人丨蕾蕾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>影后附体丨红提</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>糊弄学满分丨周四</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【你将听到】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">1:04</a> &nbsp;</span></strong><span>天津人民对吃的执念</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">2:37</a> &nbsp;</span></strong><span>滁州儿童的童年阴影</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> </span></strong><span>新疆人民的百花齐放</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="271">04:31</a></span></strong><span> 送命题①</span><strong><span>·</span></strong><span>被问工作/收入</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a></span></strong><span> 送命题②</span><strong><span>·</span></strong><span>被问对象/催婚</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">08:48</a></span></strong><span> 附加题①</span><strong><span>·</span></strong><span>应对亲戚小妙招</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a> </span></strong><span>&nbsp;附加题②</span><strong><span>·</span></strong><span>人见人爱的万能吉祥话</span></p>]]></description>
